<title>INDIA: India Dr Reddy's 1996/97 net slides.</title>
<headline>India Dr Reddy's 1996/97 net slides.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	   335.27     vs     501.78</p>
<p>    Sales		2,499.36     vs   2,203.31</p>
<p>    Div (in rupees)	3.00     vs	 3.00</p>
<p>    Other income	  23.87     vs     144.72</p>
<p>    Expenditure	2,030.18     vs   1,751.84</p>
<p>    Interest		84.81     vs	55.96</p>
<p>    Gross profit	 408.24     vs     540.24</p>
<p>    Depreciation	  57.97     vs	38.46</p>
<p>    Tax		     15.00     vs	  Nil</p>
<p>Note - Dr Reddy's Laboratories Ltd is a leading pharmaceutical firm.</p>
<p>A 120.8 million rupees fall in other income and one-time write-off of 39.32 million rupees on investment losses and lower bulk drug prices affected net profits, the firm said.</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
</text>
